-- Migration 0077: NaijaFresh Phase 1 Foundation
--
-- Adds the NaijaFresh-specific product fields (freshness_status,
-- harvested_date), reuses the existing production `fresh-food` (id=100)
-- category department and its 14 existing leaf categories, adds ONLY the
-- 6 genuinely-missing approved leaf categories (400-405), 6 clearly
-- identified demo vendors (36-41), 22 demo products/listings (600-621),
-- 1 wholesale product_pricing_tiers proof-of-concept, and tags qualifying
-- products into existing collections (farm-direct/market-fresh/imported/
-- wholesale/bulk). Reuses the existing marketplace engine 2.0
-- (products/product_listings/vendors/categories/collections) — no new
-- tables, no new taxonomy department, no duplicate grocery tree.
--
-- SAFETY GUARANTEES:
--   - Forward-only, deterministic. Does NOT rewrite 0031 (documented
--     no-op placeholder covering the production category-provenance gap).
--   - Categories 100-114 already exist in production (confirmed via
--     direct d1_query audit) and are re-affirmed here idempotently
--     (WHERE NOT EXISTS) so LOCAL dev D1 — which is missing them — gets
--     them too. New leaf categories use ids 400-405 (verified free in
--     both local dev D1 and production D1 at migration-authoring time).
--   - Vendors 36-41, products/listings 600-621 verified free of collision
--     in both local dev D1 (max vendor id=35, max product id=103 in prod)
--     and production D1 (max vendor id=35, max product id=103,
--     max listing id=140) — see docs/naijafresh-phase1-2-audit.md Section 7.
--   - Does NOT touch groceries(30) or grocery-and-food(217) — that
--     taxonomy sprawl is documented, separate tech debt, untouched here.
--   - Does NOT touch ecosystem_verticals.status — `fresh` remains
--     'coming_soon' until Pat's explicit future deployment authorization.
--   - All 22 products get rating_avg=0/rating_count=0/sales_count=0 —
--     honest zero, no fabricated reviews or sales statistics.
--   - All 6 vendors get rating_avg=0/rating_count=0 — honest zero, no
--     fabricated review history for these brand-new demo sellers.
--   - delivery_days_min/max set to realistic 1-2 day fresh-food delivery
--     windows — no fabricated instant-delivery claims.
--   - source_type='seed' on every new product/listing row, matching this
--     project's established seed-data provenance marker (migration 0068).
--
-- Reconciliation reference: docs/naijafresh-phase1-2-audit.md Section 3
-- (category mapping) and Section 7 (ID collision audit).

PRAGMA foreign_keys = OFF;

-- ============================================================
-- SECTION 1: Fresh-specific product fields (additive, nullable)
-- ============================================================
ALTER TABLE products ADD COLUMN freshness_status TEXT;
ALTER TABLE products ADD COLUMN harvested_date TEXT;

-- ============================================================
-- SECTION 2: Idempotent re-affirmation of production's EXISTING
-- fresh-food (100) department + 14 leaf categories (101-114).
-- These already exist in production (verified via d1_query) but are
-- MISSING from local dev D1. WHERE NOT EXISTS makes this a no-op on
-- production and a backfill on local dev. Values copied verbatim from
-- the production row dump captured in the audit (see Section 7).
-- ============================================================
